<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Bozorg et al. (2014), Sampathkumar et al. (2014), Hamant et al. (2008) & Uyttewaal et al. (2012) shoot apical meristem pressurized shell stress tensor, stress-vs-strain CMT alignment, and katanin organ boundary morphogenesis (Arabidopsis thaliana (shoot apical meristem L1 epidermal shell, organ-meristem saddle boundary, cylindrical stem, and epidermal cells))",
        "Bozorg et al. (2014), Sampathkumar et al. (2014), Hamant et al. (2008) & Uyttewaal et al. (2012) shoot apical meristem pressurized shell stress tensor, stress-vs-strain CMT alignment, and katanin organ boundary morphogenesis faithfully reproduces Arabidopsis thaliana (shoot apical meristem L1 epidermal shell, organ-meristem saddle boundary, cylindrical stem, and epidermal cells) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2008-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Arabidopsis thaliana (shoot apical meristem L1 epidermal shell, organ-meristem saddle boundary, cylindrical stem, and epidermal cells) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 53.1/100, audit 2026-10-19-microtubule-stress-meristem-audit) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2008-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem.py> ;
    schema:about "Arabidopsis thaliana (shoot apical meristem L1 epidermal shell, organ-meristem saddle boundary, cylindrical stem, and epidermal cells)" ;
    pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2008-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem.py; output: docs/media/microtubule_stress_meristem_comparison.png; organism: Arabidopsis thaliana (shoot apical meristem L1 epidermal shell, organ-meristem saddle boundary, cylindrical stem, and epidermal cells); checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1; spec_fingerprint: 58c04b2b1d6826f3891b148876d3e11ab4e8c9ee2c8ea4cca35459f9bbf26dca; artifact_sha256: 4afaa1f945e5e7253ded4a4b5280ca50170e37821c12fd17006d770ab81eacd7; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/microtubule_stress_meristem/arabidopsis_meristem_boundary_specimen.jpg=3a8b54b71f7c780c..., datasets/microtubule_stress_meristem/microtubule_stress_meristem_reference.json=3e04a6dded528819..., datasets/microtubule_stress_meristem/paper_citations.bib=9355fa7c7b784918..., datasets/microtubule_stress_meristem/scout_manifest.json=e3cd62cc5263f317...}" ;
    pk:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cell.2012.02.048>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1165594>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pcbi.1003410>,
        <https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.01967> ;
    pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-code-traceability>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-model-fidelity>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-morphometric-validation>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-overall>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-parameter-expressivity>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-repro-package>,
