    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-microtubule-stress-meristem-audit-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-microtubule-stress-meristem-audit-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-2>,
