<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-hamant-microtubule-stress-meristem-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Bozorg et al. (2014), Sampathkumar et al. (2014), Hamant et al. (2008) & Uyttewaal et al. (2012) shoot apical meristem pressurized shell stress tensor, stress-vs-strain CMT alignment, and katanin organ boundary morphogenesis — Model fidelity to source: 54/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Computes only closed-form algebraic sphere and cylinder Young-Laplace stress ratios (`compute_baseline_shell_stresses`, L25-40), omitting the negative-Gaussian-curvature organ-meristem saddle boundary (K = kappa_1 * kappa_2 < 0), the Bozorg et al. (2014) stress-vs-strain feedback comparison, anisotropic viscoplastic Lockhart cell-wall growth, laser single-cell ablation ring stress reorientation, and katanin (`bot1`/`ktn1`) / Oryzalin feedback gain perturbations." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
